  "title": "PPL Foundation awards $500,000 to help Pennsylvania communities thrive",
  "summary": "From helping families access nutritious food and stable housing to expanding educational opportunities and workforce training, local nonprofits make a meaningful difference in their communities every day. The PPL Foundation recently awarded $500,000 in Empowering Communities grants to 57 nonprofit organizations throughout PPL Electric Utilities’ service area to support this essential work. These grants reflect […]",
